{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4577c0f9125827e06a896849f298b8554cdcbcde4019219f74a286fecd6f8d65","ja":"ワン・ツー・スリー・フォー……っと！","zh":"One、Two、Three、Four……好嘞！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c655e2a14e326602cce8e73ffb4c8e78446ae1650e91487ff994c0999410ba98","ja":"よし！\nダンスレッスンはここまでにしようか！","zh":"好！\n舞蹈练习就先到这里吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"60db38fdf0c08fcbb85fc3b8d3d59b564c20f6dc56166749da57b14df324b179","ja":"真さん、ちょっとお伺いしたいんですけど……。\n私たちの動きに、淑女のような気品はありましたか？","zh":"真小姐，我想请教一下……\n我们的动作里，有展现出淑女般的高雅气质吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a2eeed7d5b232007050a554f6be90ffcd410062875869b4454dae6a22be75d6f","ja":"うん！　すっごくキレイに動けてたと思うよ！","zh":"嗯！我觉得动作真的非常优美哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7024f8b4377e7fecd7715f814c3c8f57a8deac7669fe01a3ec3b7650b35a8fb3","ja":"そうなんですね、よかった～♪　私たちだけだと、\nちゃんとできてるかわかりづらくて。","zh":"是这样啊，太好了～♪　光靠我们自己，\n很难弄清楚到底有没有做好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1b2a4344867f4a95b72a4c2e361c81266c039de84487c51860e58f410a604627","ja":"他の人からどう見えてるかって、大事だもんね！","zh":"在别人眼里是怎样的形象，也是很重要的嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"273450a23f39ee16298b2f9edca9b99f7232ed86bf2da13275e5b74278c71272","ja":"どう見えてるかが大事……あっ、伊織さんの\n言ってたことって、そういうことだったんだ！","zh":"在别人眼里是怎样的才重要……啊，伊织小姐\n之前说的，原来是那个意思啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"cf469418f52e4f99d942e0941650852a367001dd0991183a70bd4075cf2731b6","ja":"えっ、なになに？　どういうこと！？","zh":"诶，什么什么？这是怎么回事！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b3e12b51277f2407d49308e46436ab6eb2e9ac479cd1457ececd1c17311c8e70","ja":"役を演じるために淑女の特訓を頑張ったけど、\n所作や姿勢って、人をキレイに見せるのが目的よね。","zh":"为了演好角色虽然很努力地进行了淑女特训，\n但举止和姿势，本来就是为了让人看起来更美丽嘛。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"3c56e46d2470b9add711e83966d2fc418f75b7504b6b811f733f1789f2a7fb5e","ja":"それが無意識のうちにダンスにも活かされて、\n先生に褒められたんじゃないかしら？","zh":"可能是无意识中把它运用到了舞蹈里，\n所以才得到了老师的夸奖吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"08a63cdc4fba842452e7737b10277e220e78427b87cb5e4254c95f811a1ecc52","ja":"なんだかよく分からないけど……\n大事なことに気づけたみたいだね。","zh":"虽然不太明白是怎么回事……\n不过好像意识到了很重要的事情呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"85f1ec74ebfbaf655c45175bbf39f2d2489c4fb073845c88a6a034b91689db24","ja":"はい！　もしかしたら、普段から淑女でいたら、\nもっともっとダンスがうまくなるかも♪","zh":"好的！说不定平时一直保持淑女风范的话，\n跳舞就会变得更加厉害呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e12aa132f8ec3dfc5ab0b320f120a8b65428ee027f204edc1bc2aa4966d063fc","ja":"そうね、やってみましょう！","zh":"好啊，试试看吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e","ja":"そして……","zh":"然后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"0a23e567c99e05bc677913229c1164feae0a1d5b6ef110df09b62ec2cbbc3003","ja":"皆さん、おはようございます！","zh":"大家，早上好！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"3b4eed6e5657de1284a2316d725809a459b1dd6b20b6c1f14229d84f088dff93","ja":"あら、ごきげんよう、亜利沙さん。","zh":"哎呀，你好呀，亚利沙。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"e6f3a111434fcc944b7e7853e202ad5b9bfdf01feac9d6ac4c1c964a0b1d520c","ja":"ごきげんようですわ、亜利沙さん。","zh":"您好，亚利沙。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1364.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"b4cd8a1dc9e603b4c8c9bc8f11945a2be0fdcdddb365d674c2d00cd1597a2bfe","ja":"……え？　え？　お、おふたりとも変ですよ！？\nなにか変なものでも食べましたか～っ！？","zh":"……诶？诶？你、你们两位都很奇怪耶！？\n是吃了什么奇怪的东西吗～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
